{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/Logo.png?t=1742567650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Out of Stock! is a frantic cooperative local party game for 1 to 4 players. Team up with your friends and step into the shoes of overwhelmed sellers. Order new stock, refill the shelves, clean up spills and check out customers fast, before they get angry and storm out !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/Cooperative.png?t=1742567650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divide the work efficiently with your friends, manage your time to serve as many customers as possible and throw boxes around to stay ahead of the chaos. But most importantly : NEVER do anything that could upset a customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/Shops_for_everyone.png?t=1742567650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your teamwork to the test in a variety of unique shops, each with its own challenges. Adapt to conveyor belts, tricky store layouts, demanding customers, and more !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/Crazy_customers.png?t=1742567650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customers are your top priority, so don't let them have a bad shopping experience ! Make sure the shelves are always stocked, and the floors are spotless. Each customer has a unique trait : some walk slowly, some leave dirty footprints that need quick cleaning, while others get angry really,<i> really</i>\u00a0fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/Titel_Customize.png?t=1742567650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your style with dozens of different hats, haircuts and skin tones. Create your perfect store clerk and get ready to charm your customers !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>What will be included in this game :</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a 4-player cooperative <strong>local and online</strong> experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">18+ playable levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 customers archetypes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard and controller support</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1938750?t=1742567650","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/eb0e6db74c4764fdbafd63082a0b68fb20b89d02/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742567650","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/f350ead7dda084b98e08da9a791625e1be70a8aa/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742567650","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/f350ead7dda084b98e08da9a791625e1be70a8aa/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742567650","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3579470,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/Logo.png?t=1742567650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Out of Stock! is a frantic cooperative local party game for 1 to 4 players. Team up with your friends and step into the shoes of overwhelmed sellers. Order new stock, refill the shelves, clean up spills and check out customers fast, before they get angry and storm out !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/Cooperative.png?t=1742567650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Divide the work efficiently with your friends, manage your time to serve as many customers as possible and throw boxes around to stay ahead of the chaos. But most importantly : NEVER do anything that could upset a customer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/Shops_for_everyone.png?t=1742567650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put your teamwork to the test in a variety of unique shops, each with its own challenges. Adapt to conveyor belts, tricky store layouts, demanding customers, and more !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/Crazy_customers.png?t=1742567650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customers are your top priority, so don't let them have a bad shopping experience ! Make sure the shelves are always stocked, and the floors are spotless. Each customer has a unique trait : some walk slowly, some leave dirty footprints that need quick cleaning, while others get angry really,<i> really</i>\u00a0fast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/extras/Titel_Customize.png?t=1742567650\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your style with dozens of different hats, haircuts and skin tones. Create your perfect store clerk and get ready to charm your customers !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>What will be included in this game :</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">a 4-player cooperative <strong>local and online</strong> experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">18+ playable levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 customers archetypes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Characters customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Keyboard and controller support</p></li></ul>","developers":["Studio Maxi Mini"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1938750/5b4589fb4e3813921f67df03e428fbafee69388c/header.jpg?t=1742567650","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257110382,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110382/movie480.mp4?t=1742567647","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110382/movie_max.mp4?t=1742567647"},"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257110382/ab99c4c4380c6a87bae2684c7608814b49852f76/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1742567647","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110382/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1742567647","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257110382/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1742567647"}}],"name":"Out of Stock!","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-10510U / 1.80GHz - 2.30GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce MX250<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 750 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> /<br></li><li><